# Compiled native artifacts are NOT committed. A libsqlite3 build is ~1.5MB
# stripped and much larger unstripped, it is per-platform and per-libc, and a
# binary in git can never be audited in review. CI builds or installs one; see
# CONTRIBUTING.md for the local recipe. Nothing in this repo should ever need a
# checked-in .so.
#
# Note the scoping: vendor/ itself is SOURCE (the build script, the selector,
# the smoke test) and must stay tracked. Only its build outputs are ignored. A
# bare `vendor/` pattern matches any directory of that name at any depth and
# silently swallows the whole directory; check with `git check-ignore -v`.
vendor/lib/
vendor/.src/
build/
dist/
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.o
*.a
*.lib

# SQLite amalgamation sources fetched to build a library with
# SQLITE_ENABLE_PREUPDATE_HOOK. Reproducible from a URL + checksum, so they are
# a download, not source.
sqlite-amalgamation-*/
sqlite-amalgamation-*.zip

# Databases produced by examples and tests, and the WAL/SHM files beside them.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*-wal
*-shm

# Deno's module/plug cache when it is pinned into the workspace (CI does this
# so the driver's downloaded library, if any, is cacheable).
.deno/
deno_dir/
coverage/
*.lcov

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local environment
.env
.env.local
